"""WS2812C-2020-V6 - 3.3-5.3 V addressable RGB LED, single-wire data, 2.2 x 2.0 mm SMD-4P.

Datasheet: Worldsemi WS2812C-2020-V6 V1.0 (2026-05-21, "upgraded from the WS2812C-2020-V1"),
9 pages, LCSC C55109522 ("WS-DS").

Supply: VDD +3.3 to +5.3 V (WS-DS p.2, maximum ratings table, "电源电压"); the LED is rated at
5 V and the driving voltage must never exceed 7 V; a reversed supply does not damage it; static
current below 1 uA; "stable supply down to 3.3 V" (p.1 features). The electrical, switching and
LED tables are given at VDD = 5 V only: 3.3 V appears only in the feature text and the ratings
range. Datasheet V1.1 p5 (Chinese edition, the "VF" curve) shows each channel's constant-current
sink holding 4.95-4.99 mA from 0.4 V across it, so a channel keeps its full current while its
LED's VF is at most VDD - 0.4 V; at 3.3 V that is the knee for green (boards/main2 Peripherals.zen
works it out for its rail). VDD is declared with the 3.3-5.3 V range, so a rail whose
declared range dips below 3.3 V raises a build warning.

Data (WS-DS p.3, VDD = 5 V): DI VIH 0.55 x VDD min (1.82 V at 3.3 V), VIL 0.7 V max, input
range -0.3 V to VDD + 0.7 V (p.2), input current +-1 uA, input capacitance 15 pF max; DI to DO
delay 300 ns max. V1.0 calls DI and DO interchangeable ("输入输出信号任意对调，不分方向", p.2 pin table); V1.1 drops
that wording, so wire DI to DO.
Bit timing (p.3-4): T0H 220-380 ns, T1H 580 ns-1 us, T0L 580 ns-1 us, T1L 580 ns-1 us (the
low times are capped at 1 us, unlike the WS2815C's 5 us), reset (RES) low >= 280 us; up to
800 kbit/s; 24 bits per LED, GRB order, MSB first. DO re-shapes and forwards the data.

Current: 5 mA per colour channel (p.1 features); LED table (p.3) at 5 mA: red 100-150 mcd
620-630 nm, green 250-400 mcd 520-530 nm, blue 45-75 mcd 464-470 nm.

External parts: a 100 nF filter capacitor on VDD ("C1 ... 一般取值 100NF", p.5 typical
application circuit); integrator-owned.

Pins (p.2, "引出端排列及功能"): 1 DO, 2 GND, 3 DI, 4 VDD; same top-view arrangement as the
WS2815C-2020-4P. Package (p.2): 2.20 x 2.00 mm, 0.84 mm high; solder pad drawing 0.7 x 0.7 mm
pads, 1.13 mm apart across the body and 0.40 mm along it. Footprint: the LCSC/EasyEDA land of
C55109522, identical to the WS2815C-2020-4P's: pad 1 (-0.865, -0.55), 2 (-0.865, +0.55),
3 (+0.865, +0.55), 4 (+0.865, -0.55), 0.8 x 0.8 mm. Moisture sensitivity level 5a; bake 70-75 C
for >= 24 h (reel) or 120 C for 4 h (loose) before reflow (p.8).
"""

VDD = io(Power(voltage="3.3V to 5.3V"))
GND = io(Ground)
DI = io(Net)
DO = io(Net)

Component(
    name="LED",
    prefix="D",
    symbol=Symbol(library="WS2812C-2020.kicad_sym"),
    footprint=File("LED-SMD_4P-L2.2-W2.0-P1.00_WS2812C-2020-V6.kicad_mod"),
    part=Part(mpn="WS2812C-2020-V6", manufacturer="Worldsemi"),
    pins={
        "DO": DO,
        "GND": GND,
        "DI": DI,
        "VDD": VDD,
    },
)
